# Croupier main delivery

- Work only on `main` in private `Jakeminator123/github-work`, as requested by
  Jakob on 2026-10-02. Do not create another branch or worktree unless requested.
- GitLab integration is paused: no inbox fetch/send, wiki publication or mirror
  push. Historical GitLab delivery instructions do not apply.
- Before a shared push, run `node tools/croupier-chef.mjs status` and follow
  `AGENTS.md` ownership instructions. Commit only task-owned files.
- Deliver with `node tools/push-github-work.mjs`. It checks the exact GitHub
  destination, ancestry and the published commit. The compatibility entry point
  `push-work-mirrors.mjs` also uses GitHub only.
- Do not force-push, publish other branches or use the retired `gitlab-work` repo.
- This rule governs agent deliveries; it does not activate a role or background job.
